{"seq":3,"slug":"data-element-taxonomy-mapping","title":"必备数据元素体系与跨制度语义映射：从 10+2 元素到 ICS2 报文元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/predeparture-cargo-security-manifest-filing/security-manifest-regime-model/data-element-taxonomy-mapping","wordCount":2696,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"必备数据元素体系与跨制度语义映射-从-10-2-元素到-ics2-报文元素\">必备数据元素体系与跨制度语义映射：从 10+2 元素到 ICS2 报文元素</h1><p>同一票从宁波到汉堡的集装箱货，会在三个系统里留下三份&quot;舱单语义&quot;记录：美国 CBP 的 ISF 10+2、欧盟 ICS2 的入境摘要申报（ENS）、承运人的主提单。它们看似都在描述&quot;这批货是什么、谁发的、谁收的&quot;，逐元素对齐时却发现——<strong>同一语义槽位在不同制度下装的是不同的东西</strong>：ISF 的&quot;收货人编号&quot;是美国税号，ENS 的&quot;收货人&quot;是 EORI 号；ISF 要求&quot;原产国&quot;，ENS 核心元素里根本没有原产国。把错位当成&quot;字段名不一样&quot;来处理，是这类系统上线后最典型的返工来源。本文给出元素体系的分层模型、ISF 与 ICS2 的清单对照，以及同一数据字典如何投影成三份互不冲突的报文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-数据元素是-语义槽位-不是-字段名\">核心概念：数据元素是&quot;语义槽位&quot;，不是&quot;字段名&quot;</h2><p>把各制度的数据要求直接落成数据库列，是失败设计的起点。正确的抽象是三层：<strong>语义槽位（semantic slot）→ 制度元素（regime element）→ 报文片段（message field）</strong>。语义槽位是稳定层，描述&quot;这条信息在业务上是什么&quot;（如&quot;收货方&quot;&quot;运输单据号&quot;）；制度元素是该槽位在某制度里的具体元素名（ISF 的 <code>Consignee number</code>、ENS 的 <code>Consignee</code>）；报文片段是它在报文里的实际编码与类型。</p>\n<p>分层收益可验证：给定规范化业务记录 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，某制度报文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 在制度投影 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下的像，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>e</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 在 </mtext><mi>r</mi><mtext> 中有可解析值</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_g = \\pi_g(r) = \\{\\, e \\mid e \\in E_g,\\ \\mathrm{src}(e)\\ \\text{在}\\ r\\ \\text{中有可解析值} \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">src</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">中有可解析值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该制度元素全集。投影不是恒等映射：同一槽位在 ISF 与 ENS 里可能是<strong>不同的标识符命名空间</strong>，甚至<strong>一有一无</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  DOC[源单据&lt;br/&gt;发票 / 装箱单 / 主提单 / 分提单] --&gt; CAN[规范化元素仓&lt;br/&gt;semantic slots + 命名空间限定]&#10;  CAN --&gt;|pi_ISF| A[ISF 10 项&lt;br/&gt;进口商侧]&#10;  CAN --&gt;|pi_AMS| B[AMS 主/分舱单&lt;br/&gt;承运人 / NVOCC]&#10;  CAN --&gt;|pi_ENS| C[ICS2 ENS&lt;br/&gt;承运人层 + House 层]&#10;  A --&gt; CBP[CBP 系统]&#10;  B --&gt; CBP&#10;  C --&gt; EU[EU ICS2 中央系统]&#10;  B --&gt; WCO[WCO SAFE 协调数据集]&#10;  C --&gt; WCO\">graph TD\n  DOC[源单据&lt;br/&gt;发票 / 装箱单 / 主提单 / 分提单] --&gt; CAN[规范化元素仓&lt;br/&gt;semantic slots + 命名空间限定]\n  CAN --&gt;|pi_ISF| A[ISF 10 项&lt;br/&gt;进口商侧]\n  CAN --&gt;|pi_AMS| B[AMS 主/分舱单&lt;br/&gt;承运人 / NVOCC]\n  CAN --&gt;|pi_ENS| C[ICS2 ENS&lt;br/&gt;承运人层 + House 层]\n  A --&gt; CBP[CBP 系统]\n  B --&gt; CBP\n  C --&gt; EU[EU ICS2 中央系统]\n  B --&gt; WCO[WCO SAFE 协调数据集]\n  C --&gt; WCO</pre><p>WCO 的 SAFE 框架对入境、出境与过境运输的提前货物信息（ACI）做了<strong>协调化</strong>，其数据集是成员制度对齐的共同参照（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/-/media/wco/public/global/pdf/topics/facilitation/instruments-and-tools/tools/safe-package/advance-cargo-information-aci-implementation-guidanceen-web.pdf\">WCO ACI Guidelines, 2018</a>）。但&quot;协调&quot;不等于&quot;统一&quot;：它定义的是<strong>共同核心</strong>，各成员仍可增删。</p>\n<h2 id=\"isf-10-2-以-当事人-为重心的元素清单\">ISF 10+2：以&quot;当事人&quot;为重心的元素清单</h2><p>美国 10+2 规则（2009-01-26 生效）针对<strong>以船舶运抵美国</strong>的进口货物；违规后果是罚款、增加查验与货物延误（<a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov/border-security/ports-entry/cargo-security/importer-security-filing-102\">CBP, ISF &quot;10+2&quot;</a>）。它的元素结构有一个鲜明特征：<strong>进口商负责的 10 项里，过半是在描述&quot;人&quot;，而非&quot;物&quot;</strong>——这源于 ISF 的原始风险目标是恐怖主义相关的当事人与货物关联。</p>\n<p>进口商须在<strong>装船前 24 小时</strong>（外港装船前，通常指母船，非馈运船舶）提交的 10 项元素为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>元素（英文）</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>注意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Manufacturer / supplier name and address</td>\n<td>制造商或供应商</td>\n<td>&quot;制造方&quot;，非发货方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Seller name and address</td>\n<td>卖方</td>\n<td>与供应商常不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Buyer name and address</td>\n<td>买方</td>\n<td>与进口商常不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Ship-to name and address</td>\n<td>最终收货地</td>\n<td>可与买方地址不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Container stuffing location</td>\n<td>装箱地</td>\n<td>可内陆，非装货港</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Consolidator / stuffer name and address</td>\n<td>拼箱人</td>\n<td>与货代非同一主体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Importer of record number / FTZ applicant ID</td>\n<td>进口商记录号</td>\n<td>美国税号命名空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Consignee number(s)</td>\n<td>收货人编号</td>\n<td><strong>CBP 序列号，非名称</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>Country of origin</td>\n<td>原产国</td>\n<td>关税与风险要素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Commodity HTSUS number (6-digit)</td>\n<td>商品编码</td>\n<td>6 位，非 10 位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>承运人负责的 2 项与进口商 10 项<strong>性质不同</strong>：它们不是&quot;申报值&quot;而是<strong>作业遥测</strong>——船舶积载计划（VSP）与集装箱状态报文（CSM）。VSP 描述每个集装箱在船上的实际位置，CSM 描述集装箱每一次状态变迁（装船、卸船、进堆场）。两项时限与 10 项<strong>方向相反</strong>：VSP 在船离最后外国港后约 48 小时内、CSM 在事件后约 24 小时内提交（<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-19/chapter-I/part-149\">19 CFR Part 149</a>）——即它们是<strong>在途</strong>数据。这个&quot;事前 + 在途&quot;的双时限结构最容易被压平：只在&quot;装船&quot;一个时点触发申报的系统，无法表达 VSP/CSM 的滚动更新语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ics2-ens-以-运输与货物-为重心-且被拆成多段\">ICS2 ENS：以&quot;运输与货物&quot;为重心，且被拆成多段</h2><p>欧盟 ICS2（Import Control System 2）把入境摘要申报（ENS）重建为 UCC 体系下的电子申报，法律依据是欧盟海关法典 Regulation (EU) No 952/2013 及 Delegated Regulation (EU) 2015/2446（<strong>ENS 数据要求写在 Annex B</strong>）与 Implementing Regulation (EU) 2015/2447（<strong>时限与格式</strong>）。与 ISF 相比，ENS 重心明显偏向<strong>运输作业与货物本身</strong>：当事人、运输工具、地点、货物品目四组。</p>\n<p>ENS 的关键结构创新是<strong>多段申报（multiple filing）</strong>：一条供应链上，承运人提交&quot;承运人层（carrier-level）&quot;ENS，覆盖主运输合同层数据；持有 House 合同的 NVOCC、货代等&quot;House 层申报人&quot;提交&quot;House 层&quot;ENS，覆盖分单层的收货人、货物描述等。<strong>每个元素归属于且仅归属于一个层级</strong>，这正是&quot;谁该报哪个字段&quot;的系统化表达——它把<a href=\"filing-party-role-liability\">申报主体角色链与责任划分</a>从人治约定变成报文结构约束。</p>\n<p>ENS 元素分四组：<strong>当事人</strong>（发货人、收货人、通知方、申报人/承运人及代表，各带名称、地址与识别号 EORI）；<strong>运输</strong>（离境与越境运输工具、识别号与国籍、运输方式、集装箱指示符）；<strong>地点</strong>（装货地、卸货地、首次入境地、途经国）；<strong>货物品目</strong>（货物描述、毛重、件数与包装种类、HS 6 位编码、危险品 UN 号、运输单据号）。</p>\n<p>ENS 时限按运输方式分档，是<strong>到港/离境前</strong>的倒计时（Delegated Regulation (EU) 2015/2446 第 105 条）：海运深水<strong>装船前 24 小时</strong>、海运短途<strong>到港前 4 小时</strong>、空运<strong>到港前 4 小时</strong>、铁路<strong>到港前 2 小时</strong>、公路<strong>到港前 1 小时</strong>。与 ISF 的&quot;装船前 24 小时&quot;相比，ENS 在非海运方式上是<strong>到港倒计时</strong>——同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn><mtext>h</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t-24\\text{h}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">h</span></span></span></span></span></span> 在两制度下锚在不同事件上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨制度语义映射-同槽位-不同口径\">跨制度语义映射：同槽位、不同口径</h2><p>把两份清单按语义槽位并排，差异才显形。下表&quot;WCO 核心集&quot;列表示该语义是否属于 SAFE 协调数据集的共同核心，不代表成员不会增减。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语义槽位</th>\n<th>ISF 10+2</th>\n<th>ICS2 ENS</th>\n<th>WCO 核心集</th>\n<th>差异要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发货方</td>\n<td>无（用车/卖方近似）</td>\n<td>consignor</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>ISF 缺此槽位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收货方</td>\n<td>Ship-to + Consignee number</td>\n<td>consignee + notify</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>CBP 号 vs EORI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖方/买方</td>\n<td>有（元素 2、3）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>ISF 独有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品描述</td>\n<td>无自由文本（以 HTS 代）</td>\n<td>description of goods</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>ENS 需文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品编码</td>\n<td>HTSUS 6 位</td>\n<td>HS 6 位</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>HTS vs HS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毛重/件数</td>\n<td>进口商侧不要求</td>\n<td>gross mass + packages</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>属承运人侧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装箱地</td>\n<td>container stuffing location</td>\n<td>place of loading</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>粒度不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原产国</td>\n<td>country of origin</td>\n<td><strong>核心集不含</strong></td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>关键错位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运输单据号</td>\n<td>无（用 booking 关联）</td>\n<td>transport document number</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>ENS/AMS 必备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集装箱号</td>\n<td>无（仅装箱地）</td>\n<td>container indicator</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>ISF 靠 CSM 覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次入境地</td>\n<td>由 CBP 港口推定</td>\n<td>place of first arrival</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>显式 vs 隐式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类错位须在代码里显式建模：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>命名空间错位</strong>——&quot;收货人&quot;在 ISF 里是 <code>Consignee number</code>（美国税号域），在 ENS 里是 <code>consignee</code> 的 EORI（经营者域）。二者不可互相赋值，字典里须把标识符类型作为槽位的<strong>限定维度</strong>，写作 <code>consignee(us_cbp_number)</code> 与 <code>consignee(eori)</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>一有一无</strong>——ISF 的&quot;卖方/买方&quot;与 ENS 的&quot;通知方&quot;在对方制度里无对应项。用&quot;必填&quot;布尔量硬凑会造出无意义字段；应让适配层按各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 投影，缺失即不投。</li>\n<li><strong>粒度错位</strong>——ISF 的&quot;装箱地&quot;问的是<strong>集装箱在哪里被装入</strong>（可内陆），ENS 的&quot;装货地&quot;问的是<strong>货物在哪个港口装上船</strong>。复用同名近似槽位必须带粒度标签。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个常见错误是&quot;跨制度总分&quot;式设计：给记录算总完整度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>已填</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>应有</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = |\\text{已填}| / |\\text{应有}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已填</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应有</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随制度变化，同一记录对 ISF 与对 ENS 的完整度<strong>本就不同</strong>，必须按制度分别计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地-单一元素仓-制度适配层\">工程落地：单一元素仓 + 制度适配层</h2><p>把这套映射做成系统，推荐<strong>一个规范化元素仓（canonical store）+ 每制度一个适配器（regime adapter）</strong>。元素仓只存语义槽位及其命名空间限定值；适配器声明本制度三件事：元素全集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、每元素的<strong>必填性</strong>（required / optional / conditional）与<strong>时限锚点</strong>（装货前 or 到港前）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>适配器</th>\n<th>元素重心</th>\n<th>时限锚点</th>\n<th>层级拆分</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ISF</td>\n<td>当事人（10 项）</td>\n<td>装船前 24h（母船）</td>\n<td>进口商项 + 承运人项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMS</td>\n<td>运输与货物</td>\n<td>装船前 24h</td>\n<td>主舱单 + 分舱单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ICS2 ENS</td>\n<td>运输与货物</td>\n<td>按方式：装货前/到港前</td>\n<td>承运人层 + House 层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WCO ACI</td>\n<td>共同核心</td>\n<td>成员自定义</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>适配器的关键接口是<strong>投影 + 校验</strong>：投影把元素仓读成该制度报文；校验回读报文中每个必填槽位是否解析出<strong>合法命名空间的值</strong>（而不只是&quot;非空&quot;）。只有&quot;非空校验&quot;的适配器会在 EORI 位置塞进美国税号时不报错——这正是事后被退单的典型原因。又因 ISF 承运人两项是<strong>在途滚动</strong>数据，元素仓还须区分&quot;静态槽位&quot;（商品、当事人）与&quot;时序槽位&quot;（集装箱状态），否则更新语义无从判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据元素须抽象为三层：<strong>语义槽位 → 制度元素 → 报文片段</strong>；报文是规范化记录在制度投影 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下的像，而非恒等映射。</li>\n<li><strong>ISF 10+2 以当事人为重心</strong>：10 项进口商元素里过半描述&quot;人&quot;，收货人编号是 <strong>CBP 序列号</strong>而非名称；2 项承运人元素（VSP/CSM）是<strong>在途时序数据</strong>，时限锚点在离港后、事件后（<a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov/border-security/ports-entry/cargo-security/importer-security-filing-102\">CBP 10+2</a>、<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-19/chapter-I/part-149\">19 CFR 149</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>ICS2 ENS 以运输与货物为重心</strong>，依据 Regulation (EU) No 952/2013、Delegated Regulation (EU) 2015/2446（Annex B 定义数据要求）与 Implementing Regulation (EU) 2015/2447；其<strong>多段申报</strong>把元素分到承运人层与 House 层，时限按方式为装货前 24h / 到港前 4h、2h、1h。</li>\n<li>三类错位须显式建模：<strong>命名空间错位</strong>（CBP 号 vs EORI）、<strong>一有一无</strong>（ISF 卖方/买方、ENS 通知方）、<strong>粒度错位</strong>（装箱地 vs 装货地）。</li>\n<li>工程解是<strong>单一元素仓 + 制度适配层</strong>，适配器声明元素全集、必填性与时限锚点；校验须核<strong>命名空间合法性</strong>而非仅非空，并区分静态槽位与时序槽位。WCO SAFE 协调数据集只提供对齐基准，不替代各制度的差异处理（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/-/media/wco/public/global/pdf/topics/facilitation/instruments-and-tools/tools/safe-package/advance-cargo-information-aci-implementation-guidanceen-web.pdf\">WCO ACI Guidelines</a>）；元素该由谁提供、出错罚谁，见<a href=\"filing-party-role-liability\">申报主体角色链与责任划分</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"必备数据元素体系与跨制度语义映射：从 10+2 元素到 ICS2 报文元素","id":"必备数据元素体系与跨制度语义映射-从-10-2-元素到-ics2-报文元素"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：数据元素是\"语义槽位\"，不是\"字段名\"","id":"核心概念-数据元素是-语义槽位-不是-字段名"},{"level":2,"text":"ISF 10+2：以\"当事人\"为重心的元素清单","id":"isf-10-2-以-当事人-为重心的元素清单"},{"level":2,"text":"ICS2 ENS：以\"运输与货物\"为重心，且被拆成多段","id":"ics2-ens-以-运输与货物-为重心-且被拆成多段"},{"level":2,"text":"跨制度语义映射：同槽位、不同口径","id":"跨制度语义映射-同槽位-不同口径"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地：单一元素仓 + 制度适配层","id":"工程落地-单一元素仓-制度适配层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"申报主体角色链与责任划分：进口商、承运人、NVOCC 与货代的数据责任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/predeparture-cargo-security-manifest-filing/security-manifest-regime-model/filing-party-role-liability"},"next":{"title":"舱单数据来源与主数据汇聚：订单、订舱、装箱单到申报字段的落位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/predeparture-cargo-security-manifest-filing/manifest-data-assembly-validation/manifest-data-sourcing-master-data"}}